OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters called to hotel blaze
OL,4,
OL,5,FFirefighters have been working through
OL,6,Fthe night to tackle a fire at a
OL,7,Fderelict hotel on the Isle of Wight.
OL,9,FHampshire and Isle of Wight Fire and
OL,10,FRescue Service said it received a call
OL,11,Fat about 03:30 BST reporting a blaze at
OL,12,Fthe hotel on Sandown High Street.
OL,14,FIt said crews from Shanklin, Ryde,
OL,15,FVentnor, Newport and Freshwater were
OL,16,Fsent to the scene and confirmed nobody
OL,17,Fwas injured or evacuated from the
OL,18,Fbuilding.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
