OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters called to hotel blaze
OL,4,
OL,5,FSandown High Street and Esplanade
OL,6,Fremain closed as firefighters damp down
OL,7,Fhotspots on the lower levels of the
OL,8,Fbuilding, while an aerial ladder
OL,9,Fplatform is being used to extinguish
OL,10,Fremaining flames in the roof.
